; Tai khoan rieng cho dot backtest BOT_CRT. Copy file nay thanh account.crt.ini
; roi dien so that. account.crt.ini KHONG duoc dua vao git (xem Tools/.gitignore).
;
; VI SAO CO FILE RIENG: account.local.ini dang tro toi ban cai IC Markets, la ban ma
; Topic_BOT_TLS_By_GETCHART dang chay backtest. De hai topic khong giam chan nhau,
; BOT_CRT chay o ban cai con lai (MetaTrader 5 / Exness). Run-Backtest.ps1 tu 09/2026
; chi tat DUNG ban MT5 no sap dung, nen hai ben chay doc lap duoc.
;
; Dung bang: .\Run-Backtest.ps1 -Bot BOT_CRT -Account account.crt.ini ...

Terminal=C:\Program Files\MetaTrader 5\terminal64.exe

; Tai khoan demo dung de backtest.
Login=00000000
Password=doi-mat-khau-o-day
Server=Ten-Server-MT5

; Bo trong thi script tu do qua origin.txt. Ban cai nay ung voi GUID
; D0E8209F77C8CF37AD8BF550E51FF075 tren may hien tai — nhung moi may mot khac,
; dung chep cung gia tri sang may moi.
DataFolder=

; Ky hieu vang cua Exness co hau to 'm'. Ban IC Markets thi la XAUUSD — day chinh la
